window.products.push({"id":695032,"name":"Flame Date 6 Packs Inspirational Lavender Scented Sachets for Drawer and Closet Air Freshener Deodorizer Odor Eliminator Motivational Gifts for Mother","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cQqsD4V1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Perfect Heart-Warming Gift】Flame Date sachets is not only a aromatic & pleasant gift,but also an attitude to life.Our sachets create a relaxing atmosphere and positive energy with inspirational words.You can give your coworkers and friends as goodbye gifts or give your employees as motivational gift or give your family as a inspirational gift on any occasion such as Mother's Day, Graduation, Birthday.Add on pack of sachets to your every gifts,you’ll stand out with this cute and unique gifts! 【BUYER MUST KNOW】Tie with our ribbons in wardrobe or put our sachets in all kinds of closed space,such as drawers,car,gym bag,shoe cabinet,etc.Please note that you must place it in closed place.For example,you can put it in bedroom or bathroom,but you should clips to sheets and pillows or place in drawers. If you put it in large and open space,the air will be circulated ,the smell will be lost faster,the scent will be mild,you should place more packs or replace quickly. 【Long-Lasing & Large Size】Flame Date closet freshener are made from the natural vermiculite and top quality French essential oils certified safe by SGS.We put that scented vermiculite in the scented envelope to diffuses fragrance.Each sachet measures 4.5 x 5.7 inch and is larger than others in Amazon. Adding more top-quality essential oils and update the formula ratio to ensure a long-lasting, incredible experience.From Flame Date test, It can last at least 60 days in closed space. 【Unique Design & Individual Packing】You will be so impressed and surprised their beautiful design and inspirational words when opening our lovely pink gift box!Each sachet comes in an individually sealed package so If you don't use them all at once, the scent lasts while storing.Open the Individual packing,take a deep breath,enjoy the best scent ever!Add one pack to your gift list,such a unique gift that is sure to bring someone smiles and laughter. 【Welcome to Flame Date】Flame Date is specializes in home fragrance products,including scented sachets and scented drawer liners. Our mission is to provide happiness & fragrances by offering art inspired sachets, designed to uplift your mood and enrich your home décor.All the unique designs come from a passionate young team, please search Flame Date for more creative home fragrance gifts！If you have any problems, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cQqsD4V1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flame Date","source_asin":"B0BXGL8CR3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-695032","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXGL8CR3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXGL8CR3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
