window.products.push({"id":695102,"name":"Ideaolives Olive Wood Spatula, Natural Wood Curved Spatula for Frying, Long Wooden Spoon for Flipping & Stirring, Curved Wood Utensils for Steak & Piz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617SAdp-X-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM WOODEN SPATULAS: Made of one-piece natural olive wood, these spatulas are super lightweight, durable, and functional kitchen accessories for cooking enthusiasts. Our olive wood spatula measures 13 inches x 3.15 inches, and you may use it as a frying or mixing spoon. The wood spatula with a thin head easily slips underneath, allowing you to flip the bread, omelete, and more. 100% NATURAL AND RUSTIC OLIVE WOOD: Ideaolives olive wood curved spatulas are made using premium-quality and durable Olive Wood that lasts longer and performs better. The unique grain pattern in our olivewood cooking utensils adds authenticity to your dining table. This olive wood spoon does not leach toxic chemicals into your food while you are busy cooking your favorite dishes. ERGONOMIC DESIGN WITH LONG HANDLE: These olive wood wooden spoons measure 13 inches, and the long handle protects your hands from vapor and heat while you are cooking. The curved head of our angled wood spatula allows you to flip steak, lift pizza, turn burgers, and scratch grease. The smooth and slim handle with a pre-drilled hole can be used for hanging the spatula after use. SAFE FOR NON-STICK COOKWARE: Ideaolives wooden spatula is made of solid wood, cut by machine, and then polished by hand to ensure a smooth, anti-scratch, and splinter-free surface. Our frying spatula will not damage your precious non-stick pots and metal pots and pans. You can use the olivewood flat turner for stirring, mixing, dividing, tasting, turning, flipping, and serving food. EASY TO CLEAN AND MAINTAIN: This angled wood spatula can be hand-washed using a mild detergent and let dry naturally. Moreover, these olive wood spoons make a practical gift for your friends, neighbors, relatives, or coworkers who like to cook. Furthermore, the beautiful texture and natural grains in our wooden spatula make your meal more enjoyable while adding a rustic charm to your kitchen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617SAdp-X-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ideaolives","source_asin":"B0BKZ9KVP9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-695102","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKZ9KVP9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKZ9KVP9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
