window.products.push({"id":695157,"name":"Shoe Rack Storage Organizer 5 Tiers Free Standing Metal Shoe Shelf with Side 3 Shoes Pockets, 10-17 Pairs Vertical Space Saving Stackable Tall Shoe Ra","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YVbWyioDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Large Capacity Shoe Rack】The shoe rack has the perfect size for small spaces, and the metal shoe rack layer shoe rack can store more pairs of shoes. Can store 10-17 pairs of shoes. Can be freely combined and changed the height of the shoe rack to perfectly place all kinds of shoes. There are three storage pockets on the side of the shoe rack for slippers, folding umbrellas and various small items. Metal vertical shoe cabinets can maximize space saving and provide a comfortable and tidy home. 【High Quality Shoe Rack】Shoe rack is made of high quality ABS connector, thickened washable non-woven fabric and upgraded sturdy and smooth coating corrosion resistant metal tube, good stability and prevent rust, each shoe rack holds up to 42 lbs. It is easy to clean, just wipe off the dust or mud with a damp towel. Different from the traditional design, we widen and thicken the laminate and the bracket to make the shoe rack more sturdy and stable, saying goodbye to those fragile shoe cabinets. 【Easy to Assemble】Simple structure of the shoe rack According to the attached brief assembly instructions and a small hammer, the shoe rack can be installed more easily and more firmly. You can order multiple shoe racks, splice them together into new shoe racks at will, or create more units to hold all your family members' shoes and other items and keep them organized. Shoe racks that take up very little floor space are a great solution to keep the clutter out of your home and garage. 【Wide Use】Shoe rack measures 18.1\"W x 11.4\"D x 36.4\"H. Its unique design style makes it suitable for most scenarios and easy to place in small/narrow spaces. It can be used as a bookshelf or flower stand in the living room or bedroom, and can also be used to place towels and toiletries in the bathroom. It can also be stored in the cupboard to store plates and various cutlery if desired. Works great in your entryway, closet, cupboard, wardrobe, living room or garage. 【Best After-sales Service】After receiving the shoe rack, please check the accessories, if there is any omission or have any questions, please contact us, we will provide you with a satisfactory solution within 24 hours according to your requirements. Note: Due to thermal expansion and contraction, when the weather is cold, soak the connector in warm water for a few minutes, which is more convenient for assembly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YVbWyioDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Auoftao","source_asin":"B0BGHL86V4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-695157","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGHL86V4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGHL86V4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
