window.products.push({"id":695182,"name":"KI Store Halloween Wreath with Lights and Timer for Front Door 24-Inch Witch Leg Wreath Lighted Halloween Door Decoration (NOT Pre-Stranded)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z8jcAVxRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our Halloween wreath is so packed full of classic Halloween fun: orange and cream pumpkins, maple leaves, curly twigs, looped ribbon, and what looks to be a witch. Two fabric legs, decked out in jeweled boots make it much more fun for your Halloween.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z8jcAVxRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KI","source_asin":"B0B2RLHGGN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-695182","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2RLHGGN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2RLHGGN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":695183,"name":"Canvas Print Wall Art - Custom Your Photo/Picture with Beach, Waterfall, Mountain, Canyon, Flower sea On Canvas Digitally Printed (8\" W x 6\" H)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SyYYZINJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Important: Please make sure the image you upload covers the whole canvas area; if any white borders are left on the edges please try uploading your image in another size. Any white spaces might get printed on the final product.Image Resolution: a resolution of 75 DPI is needed. In order to get good results, your digital camera resolution should not be under 4 megapixels. For the best resolution quality, upload your picture in \"JPEG\" file format. CUSTOM PHOTO DECORATIONS: In order to make a space feel like home, it helps to have colorful photos of family members, friends, pets, and inspirational places on the wall. Display fun, memorable moments from your favorite beach trip, baby’s first birthday, or your wedding day. The image will wrap around the frame so that the sides aren’t left a boring white color. UNIQUE WALL DECOR FOR HOME: Need gift ideas for home DECOR? We offer the best gift- custom canvas print made from your photos. Create a unique, one of a kind artwork that your friends and family will admire for years to come. Print your own pictures to memory the precious moment in your kids/lover/pet/animal/view/wedding/family and so on. We combine your best memories captured in photographs with our state of the art technologies and materials to create breathtaking and unique wall decoration. The final print corresponds exactly to its respective preview that you will see during the customization process using the Amazon tool. With Photo Gifts your canvas print will be produced using the latest printing technology and convince with outstanding sharpness and intense colors. Sawtooth installed, ready to hang!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SyYYZINJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIWORD","source_asin":"B0888VSCZP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-695183","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0888VSCZP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0888VSCZP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":695184,"name":"Maydear Multi-Tier Bamboo Wine Rack, Wine Racks Countertop, Freestanding Display Stand Shelves-4 Tier","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61STG-WBmjS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Material: The wine rack is made of high-quality bamboo, sturdy and durable, with strong bearing capacity and not easily deformed. Size: Size: 17\"L x 9.3\"W x 13.8\"H, each wine rack can store 16 bottles of wine. Prevent oxidation: The cork is soaked in the wine by laying the red wine to prevent air from entering and the red wine being oxidized prematurely. Humanized design: open wine tank design, neatly placed, beautiful arc, easy to access, and can maintain the stability of the bottle. Warm Tip: The wine tank is not suitable for all wine bottles. Easy to install: simple structure and convenient assembly. The package is equipped with detailed installation instructions and necessary tools and accessories, so you can easily assemble.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61STG-WBmjS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maydear","source_asin":"B0BRK67BKM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-695184","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRK67BKM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRK67BKM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":695185,"name":"2 Tier Lazy Susan Organizer, Bamboo Lazy Susan for Table, Pantry Lazy Susan Turntable for Cabinet, 12 inch Wood Kitchen Turntable Organizer, Rotating ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XzQZSCkZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【NATURAL MATERIAL】2 Tier bambo lazy susan made of natural bamboo, lightweight and strong without odor, easy to clean, and very beautiful. Simply hand wash or wipe with a damp cloth; do not soak in water or wash in the dishwasher. 【360 DEGREE ROTATING】 Designed for smooth 360-degree rotation for easy access from any seat at the table. With just a simple spin, you can access and take the item effortlessly. There are 4 anti-slip pads on the bottom of the wooden lazy susan to ensure the stability of the turntable when rotating. 【EASY TO REACH】Open design keeps items visible and easily accessible, and the taller lip (height 1\") keeps things from falling off the bamboo lazy susan organizer while rotating. Double handles on both sides make kitchen turntable organizer easy to grip and move. 【MULTI-PURPOSE CABINET ORGANIZER】Our bamboo lazy susan organizercan store anything, and make your messy cabinets tidy. Two tier kitchen turntable organizers suitable for placing condiments, bath products, jam jars, etc. It can be placed in the kitchen, bathroom, dining table, and farmhouse outdoors. 【PACKAGING】This kithchen countertop organizer can be used as spice rack organizer for cabinet in the kitchen. Top rotating spice rack diameter is 10 inches, Bottom turntable space diameter is 12 inches. This lazy susan organizer for cabinet is very easy to install and detach, no other installation tools are needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XzQZSCkZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WEIFUTCH","source_asin":"B0B1HT22QD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-695185","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1HT22QD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1HT22QD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
