window.products.push({"id":695216,"name":"Fiesta® 8.5\" Luncheon Bowl Plate | Mulberry","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.2,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41sb5H2WKRL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Is it a bowl? Is it a plate? What kind of confusion is this?! It's both! The Fiesta 8.5\" Luncheon Bowl Plate in Mulberry has a wide surface area of the traditional round luncheon plate combined with the high curved sides of a bowl to prevent any foods from sliding off & creating a monumental mess. Whether it's the perfect portion of hearty beef stew or a healthy fresh salad, the Luncheon Bowl Plate will keep your food in place. Get that perfect sprinkles (or hot fudge) to ice cream ratio on your next sundae or grab a hearty piece of French bread to swipe up every last tasty morsel in the bottom of the bowl plate. Proudly made in the USA, Fiesta protects its dinnerware pieces with a 5-year limited manufacturer's warranty against chipping under normal usage. The fully vitrified lead-free china won't absorb any odors or moisture & is resistant to cracking, chipping & fading. Along with being dishwasher safe, the 8.5\" Luncheon Bowl Plate is both microwave safe & oven proof up to 350F. Fiesta dinnerware pieces are durable enough for everyday use & can also be used as pieces of art to accent kitchen, dining room or any other place in your home. Easily color coordinate an entire dinnerware collection with matching accessories or mix & match with +15 color options! Fiesta 8.5\" Luncheon Bowl Plate (Mulberry) Features:","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41sb5H2WKRL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fiesta","source_asin":"B096SWG461","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-695216","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096SWG461","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096SWG461","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
