window.products.push({"id":695252,"name":"Oirpro Boho Throw Pillow Covers 20x20 Set of 2 Neutral Accent Modern Farmhouse Pillow Covers with Embroidered Geometric Pattern Decorative for Couch B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81E8FwKFnWS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cotton WHAT YOU GET: 2pc pillow covers 20x20 inch and our 6-month warranty.(pillow shams only,NO INSERTS).Best for 20x20 inch or 22x22 inch pillow insert. BOHO DESIGN: its simple yet unique cute boho designs combined with embroidered patterns and mixed colors,these boho throw pillow covers have a great designer look and feel,will definitely stand out in the mix.Hidden zipper on the edge is durable,and works smoothly. STUNNING QUALITY: The fabric is thick,durable yet soft,the embroidery is sturdy,dense,wrinkle-free and the stitching is very nicely done,these farmhouse throw pillow covers will definitely last the wear and tear of little ones/pets.Its texture is super luxurious and cozy.Mix-matched raised stripes pattern only available on the front side,the back is plain cotton white color. PERFECT DECOR: The colors is vibrant and bright,the pattern is quite modern and dynamic,the minimalist design will really compliments your decor.Goes well with any cute bohemian or modern chic farmhouse style of any living room,bedroom,office,nursery,or outdoor benches,patio sets,and more. WASHING GUIDE: Machine Wash Cold Separately,Tumble Dry Low or Hang to Dry,No Bleach,Do Not Iron.The luxury boho outdoor pillow covers are fade resistant,they are machine washable and always look like new","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81E8FwKFnWS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oirpro","source_asin":"B095LXCQ8N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-695252","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095LXCQ8N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095LXCQ8N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":695253,"name":"Coastal Dunes by The Macneil Studio, 12x24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.91,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ez+5CCFTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features seagulls Flying over an empty beach. Richard macneil, a self taught artist, formed the macneil studio in 2009 with his wife Judy and their sons Daniel and Kyle. Born in Winchester, macneil started his working life as an artist at Worcester royal porcelain and has always worked in the fields of sculpture, ceramics, and illustration, both in the UK and internationally. He spent many years living on the East coast of the USA, then returned to Worcestershire and freelanced as an artist and greeting card designer. Richard spends any spare time he has with his family walking in the beautiful British countryside and fishing. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ez+5CCFTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B06ZXXDPPG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-695253","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06ZXXDPPG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06ZXXDPPG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
