window.products.push({"id":695398,"name":"Auric Moon | Golden Oud + Juniper Scented Luxury Soy Coconut Candle for Women | Slow 35+ Hour Burn | Manifest & Elevate Your Space | 5.5 Oz Metal Tin ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91m+J5+tOHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GOLDEN OUD & JUNIPER: is an elegant blend of mystical aromas that are rich and invigorating to the senses. The warm sweetness of luxurious Golden Oud is balanced with refreshing Juniper. This evergreen-infused fragrance is reminiscent of a mountain hike on a beautiful crisp day. It exudes peace and tranquility while appealing to both men and women. We custom-blend with the highest concentration of essential oils and fine fragrances inspired by nature. THE WAX & WICKS: Each of our candles is hand-poured in California. We use a premium Soy, Coconut and Apricot Wax blend which burns beautifully for 35+ hours. Our 100% Cotton Core wicks are lead-free, natural and eco-friendly. When your candle wax eventually becomes low inside the jar, we encourage you to repurpose the tin by potting a small plant or using it as decorative holder. DAYDREAM: Is inspired by the full moon amongst the woodsy coast of California. Get lost within your wildest dreams! Believe in your ability to manifest any vision into reality. Our stunning, iridescent glass vessel elegantly reflects in the light while elevating the decor in your space. This luxury candle is the perfect gift for someone you love. Get her something she will adore for the holidays! INFUSED WITH PURPOSE: Oud is said to be derived from the most expensive timber in the world, making it a prized natural ingredient globally. Used since ancient times, in many cultures to calm the mind and body, while cleansing a space when burned. Escape the daily pressures of life by taking a moment for self-care to quickly raise your vibe. Ignite the flame, clear away negativity and set a beautiful intention. Breathe in the relaxing aroma of our one-of-a kind candles and feel stress melt away. OUR COMPANY: Auric Moon is a boutique, family-owned and operated company based in Los Angeles. We passionately create unique, high-end candles that elevate your mind, body, spirit and sanctuary. Our Collection was made with love and intention, which can be experienced upon opening the elegant box. We believe in doing our part to help our planet. All of our paper packing material and boxes can proudly be recycled. CRUELTY FREE, VEGAN AND FREE OF PHOSPHATES","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91m+J5+tOHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RUGGED & DAPPER","source_asin":"B08PDR5SRQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-695398","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PDR5SRQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PDR5SRQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
