window.products.push({"id":695404,"name":"Butterfly Craze Lifelike Artificial Lavender Plants - Perfect for Crafting, Home Decor, and Weddings, Pair with Fake/Dried Flowers Like Purple Roses, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81829oesE0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DON'T SETTLE FOR LESS: Made with high-quality silk material, these faux lavender sprigs offer the same beauty as real lavender without the upkeep. This bundle includes sprigs that measure between 14.5\" and 16.5\", making them ideal for creating stunning centerpieces & eye-catching table decorations. Whether you're looking for silk flowers for wedding centerpieces or faux lavender for housewarming party decor, these sprigs are the perfect choice. Don't settle for less-than-perfect decorations. MODERN FARMHOUSE DECOR: Features rustic & timeless purple faux silk flowers with stems that add a touch of elegance to any home or office. With their effortless charm & French countryside appeal, these allergy-free artificial flowers require no water or tending, making them a practical & low-maintenance addition to any space. If you want to brighten up a dull corner or create a focal point on a coffee table, these faux silk flowers are the perfect solution for those seeking a touch of beauty. SIZE: This bundle of artificial lavender sprigs is a versatile decoration item for any space. Each sprig measures between 14.5\" and 16.5\", making them perfect for table centerpieces. They also work well as accents on office desks, bathroom shelves, and entryway tables. The lifelike design and vibrant colors make them a great way to add a touch of nature to any room without the hassle of maintaining real plants. Plus, the bundle can be easily rearranged to suit your changing decor needs. REALISTIC & VERSATILE: These lifelike stems are so convincing that even your most discerning guests will have to touch them to believe they're not real. Whether you choose to display them indoors or outdoors, they're sure to bring a touch of natural beauty to any setting. The flowers are crafted with careful attention to detail, capturing the essence of real lavender in stunning detail. Plus, their sturdy construction means they're durable enough for use in your garden or patio. COLOR & ELEGANCE: These Butterfly Craze vibrant purple and green artificial lavender plants are crafted with quality materials, built to last and are even more stunning than artificial succulents. Perfect for adding a touch of nature to your home, office, or event space, these plants will brighten up any room and provide lasting beauty for years to come. Note that the vases shown in the picture are not included, but these lovely plants can be displayed in any vase or container of your choosing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81829oesE0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Butterfly Craze","source_asin":"B08XVFQ3SB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-695404","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XVFQ3SB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XVFQ3SB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
