window.products.push({"id":695412,"name":"linoroso-Dual Bento Boxes for Adults Kids|Modern Cute Stackable Lunch Box Meet ALL On-the-go Needs for Lunch Container,Salad Container for Lunch, Snac","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617eE9yjsXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅Three STACKABLE LUNCH BOX:From top to bottom each container holds 1.8, 3.5 and 4.6 Cups of foods (9.9 Cups of food or 118oz in total), so together they are perfect for packing a variety of foods anytime, anywhere you go. ✅VERSATILE:Apart from packing a full meal with three perfect portion containers, the lunch-box easily transforms to one container bentobox for small lunch/a health snack while you want to keep food portion under control. Each middle and bottome containers comes with an airtight lid, so always secure your food freshness and prevent hassle situations to the best effect. In addition, the top container also can be used as storage container for utensil sets or others (reminder: Utensil is included). ✅Modern:The design roots in our LINOROSO brand philosophy “boost lifestyle, energy and health” if you a person pursuing a quality life and fashionable health the functional stylish bentoboxes are the ideal one. The trendy and vibrant colors lunch boxes can better show your fashionable and healthy attitude. The flexible design also perfectly allows you take your health meal to work, gym, school, or even your short trip. Now you can choose one from these four colors as gift for you and beloved one ✅100% SAFE:Made with BPA-free and eco-friendly materials that complies with European & U.S. food contact grade standards. Furthermore, the stylish lunch box is subjected dishwasher, freezer and microwave safe (!!!Note:DO NOT PUT THE UPPER TRANSPARENT CONTAINER AND TOP LID INTO MICROWAVE !!!) ✅EASY TO CLEAN:Due to the odor and stain-resistance feature, The Linoroso Lunchbox cleans up with ease in the dishwasher (!!!Note: TOP SHELF DISHWASHER SAFE!!!) so cleaning is no longer a troublesome thing after enjoying the delicious meal.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617eE9yjsXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"linoroso","source_asin":"B08BLJ64VP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-695412","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BLJ64VP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BLJ64VP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
