window.products.push({"id":695515,"name":"Homykic Bamboo Bookshelf, 5-Tier Narrow 55.9” Adjustable Book Shelf Bookcase Bathroom Shelves Freestanding Storage Stand for Living Room, Bedroom, Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":74.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712Pou3JkHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BAMBOO SHELF FOR SMALL SPACES - 17.72\"L * 12.4\"W * 55.91\"H, narrow storage shelf perfect fit any room, creating more storage space for your home without taking up too much space. The height of each storage shelf can be adjusted according to your hobbies or the height of the items. This bamboo shelf will bring a natural aesthetic style to your home. MULTIPURPOSE STORAGE SHELF - Thick bamboo shelves with easy-to-tight screws can withstand heavy loads without being easily bent or deformed, each shelf can accommodate up to 33lbs. Open wide design provides more space for storage, can be used as a bookshelf, bathroom shelf, plant stand, kitchen shelf, for holding books, photo frames, plants, towels, baskets, and so on. Keep your favorite accent pieces displayed and organized with a little help from this shelving unit. SUPERIOR BAMBOO SHELF UNIT - Keep clutter under control with this amazing tall storage shelf. Made of 100% natural bamboo material, durable and delicate. The surface of the shelf unit is coated with waterproof varnish, which can be used in the bathroom, living room, study room, reading room, home office, kitchen, and balcony. Our bookshelf can stand the test of time. STABLE & DURABLE BOOKSHELF - Structured with solid bamboo for extended durability, overall weight is 9.83lbs. You can easily move the storage shelf and place it wherever you want. Perfectly spaced bars prevent the books from falling into the gap. EASY ASSEMBLY - Tighten the shelves with screws as needed to complete the installation. Only 2 steps are required and no more than 10 minutes. Our easy-to-follow assembly instructions will guide you through each step. If the received item is defective, please feel free to contact Homykic customer support. EASY TO MAINTENANCE - The surface of the bookshelf is smooth and moisture-proof, it is not easy to get dirty after long-time use. If stained, please wipe it with a damp cloth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712Pou3JkHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homykic","source_asin":"B09QMHSLYM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-695515","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QMHSLYM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QMHSLYM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":695516,"name":"Grande Epicure M6008757 15-Inch Carving/Pastry Board with Juice Well","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-Ca99PMuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Grande Epicure 15-inch carving/pastry board features radius edges and a juice well on one side. This reversible board can stand the test of time and be used for carving on one side and as a pastry board on the other. Grande Epicure is best known for producing premium wood cutting boards that are hand finished by experienced craftsmen for quality workmanship at a great value. The wood is dried in a tightly controlled process to ensure a consistent moisture content which is critical in avoiding wood cracks and splitting. Hardwood. Dimensions: 15 x 21 x 3/4","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-Ca99PMuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Grande Epicure","source_asin":"B00969KLR8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-695516","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00969KLR8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00969KLR8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
