window.products.push({"id":695565,"name":"Bormioli Rocco Premium Martini Glass, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713aCbRRfmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The result of a collaboration between Bormioli Rocco and Italy’s top sommeliers, the Premium stemware line is an elegant marriage of style and function. Developed with individual varietals in mind, each Premium glass is shaped and sized to draw out the specific bouquet and flavors of a particular wine. Bormioli Rocco artisans create the glasses from single pieces of crystalline glass and give them a slender pulled stem for beautiful looks and excellent balance. Each piece minimizes heat transfer from the hand to the wine, and the extra fine rims are especially pleasant on the lip. Ranging from flutes to cognac stems, the Premium collection is made in Italy and carries the recommendation of the Association of Italian Sommeliers. With its classic shaping and elegant profile, this martini glass is a lovely addition to a collection of Premium wine stems for occasions when a stylish cocktail is in order. Beautifully flared and confident in the hand, the glass stands 7-1/4 inches high and holds 8-1/2 ounces. Made in Italy, it is packaged here in a set of four and is dishwasher safe, though washing by hand is recommended for best care. Coordinating Premium ice buckets, decanters, and water glasses are also available.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713aCbRRfmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bormioli Rocco","source_asin":"B001J54X62","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-695565","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001J54X62","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001J54X62","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
