window.products.push({"id":695586,"name":"Casa Photoreal Paris Eiffel Tower Bed-in-a-Bag, Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91fmxdw7OAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bold and Bright, the Photo Real Paris Eiffel Tower Bed in a Bag Comforter Set is sure to be a vibrant addition to your bedroom. The all-season alternative fill microfiber provides a soft cloud-like slumber. The lightweight and durable bedding is created from machine was polyester, providing cozy comfort and a unique ultra-plush comforter. The Eiffel Tower Bed in a Bag provides a contemporary and modern style to your kid, teen, or young adult’s room. The ensemble features a black and white comforter with an image of the Eiffel Tower with a hot pink accent car in the frame. The coordinating shams have cute and playful typography design with the word Paris written on the face. This kid friendly set includes a comforter, coordinating shams, fitted and flat sheets, and pillowcases. Set is available in Queen and King Sizes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91fmxdw7OAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CASA","source_asin":"B07BX9M9XG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-695586","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BX9M9XG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BX9M9XG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
