window.products.push({"id":695635,"name":"BMoC Hand Poured Soy Wax Candle in 400ml Beaker, White, 11 oz, Calm Fragrance (#BKC-CM)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sxuaFe89L._AC_SL1096_.jpg","description":"Hand poured in-house! A scientific gift that would be amazing to receive for birthdays, teacher appreciation, hostess gifts, graduations and even for no reason at all! Our own special blend of natural soy wax is cruelty free and Kosher Certified. Soy candles burn longer and cleaner, significantly reducing the amount of soot, smoke, and \"afterburn\" that commonly occurs with paraffin waxes. And because soy wax melts a lower temperature, we can use all-cotton braided wicks for efficient burning without added zinc or fibers. Hand poured in small batches, this 400ml borosilic glass laboratory beaker can actually be used in the lab after the candle is gone! Simply wipe out remaining wax with a paper towel, remove the wick and wash with soap and water. CALM: Think of a huge bouquet of lavender enhanced by a sprinkling of citrus, greens and herbs, tied together with a soft musk for a modern spin on this classic. Cheerfully packed in a white gift box full of blue paper shreds for ample protection. PLEASE NOTE: Because this wax is a natural substance, irregularities in color and smoothness (frosting) may occur and does not at all effect the performance of the candle. This effect is often sought after as proof that the product is created with natural soy wax. \"Considerately made by hand...TB\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sxuaFe89L._AC_SL1096_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Benz Microscope","source_asin":"B08PZJ49CR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-695635","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PZJ49CR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PZJ49CR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
