window.products.push({"id":695652,"name":"Hixon Camping Fan for Tent, Camping Fan with LED Lights, Portable & Rechargeable Solar Camping Fan with USB Charging Input-Survival Kit for Hurricane,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71850D+ADSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【2-in-1 Camping Fan and Lantern】: This camping fan has 4-speed level settings, which can meet your different needs of the airflow. You can press the wind button gently start from 1 level to a higher level. Additionally, there are 3 separate super bright large LED bulbs distributed around the fan with 4 brightness mode settings: Full brightness, half brightness, SOS mode, red flashing mode. The 3 LED lights are foldable which allows you to hide them around the fan if you do not need them. 【Powerful fan speed and bright lifhting】: High quality brushless motor for whisper operation, max wind speed 10ft/s, strong airflow and 2 setting speeds, it's great to fresh the air and keep you cool.LED lights panels with 3 setting brightness can be adjusted, it provides enough brightness for lighting up your tent or campsite 【High-power working mode】Its built-in 5200mAh large capacity battery, you can choose the timing mode, Camping fans for tents can be working for 6-25H in a different mode, charging time 6-8H. it can be used as emergency power to charge your phone like a power bank, GPS, MP3, or iPod, etc. It's a lifesaver for days of camping/trip and during hurricane season and other emergency outages. 【Comes with remote control】 which can remotely control the camping fan and light, and there are 3- speed modes to choose from. This tent fan lightweight(0.45kg) for this size (6.61*5.03*6.61inches), easy to carry and store. It also operates via a USB cable connected to the laptop, car charger, power bank and etc. 【Quality and after-sales】This outdoor fan has a built-in foldable hook at the bottom you can hang it on the tent, or place it on your office desk. Suitable for a single person or small tent lights up everything in 2-3 person tents, please buy 2 or more for a larger tent.also provide 24 month warranty and 24 hours online customer services","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71850D+ADSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hixon","source_asin":"B08ZRVPY3Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-695652","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZRVPY3Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZRVPY3Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
