window.products.push({"id":695654,"name":"Apple Slicer -3 Pack Apple Slicer Corer Apple Pear Fruit Sharp Divider Peeler Stainless Steel Cutter -4.2 Inch Large Apple Corer Tool with 8 Blades(7 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ViMSRWH4S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description: The 4.3-inch diameter Apple slicer is suitable for most medium-sized round fruits or vegetables, such as pears, potatoes, onions, tomatoes and kiwifruit. The blade is made of high-quality stainless steel, which will not be bent or broken easily. The operation is simple and fast. Considering the safety and durability, we improved the process by adding four strengthened solder joints at the joint of the blade and the central ring, which made the blade adhere more firmly and avoided the fracture and splash of the blade in the process of cutting fruit. This makes it safer to use apple slice products. Specifications and features: Diameter: 4.3 inches Length: 7.0 inches Material: stainless steel Package content: 3 Apple slicer Features: 1. Food grade stainless steel material, tasteless, non-toxic, corrosion-resistant, non stick, small volume, light weight, comfortable to hold, easy to use. 2. The modern design of this apple cutter slicer corer makes it look great when sitting on the kitchen counter or using it. 3. Light weight, easy to clean after use, reusable, very . Usage Method: 1. Choose an apple no more than 4 inches in size. 2. Align the apple slicer to the core. 3. Push the apple slicer down through the core and gently screw it off. Simple steps allow you to quickly separate the core from the fruit, and then cut the apple into 8 pieces evenly. You can use it on all kinds of fruits, such as apples, pears, potatoes, onions, tomatoes, kiwifruit and so on, to save more time and energy. Matters Needing Attention: 1. Please allow slight deviation due to manual measurement. 2. With small parts, please keep away from children under 3 years old. 3. It is made of stainless steel. Be careful not to scratch your hands when using it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ViMSRWH4S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mr Yan","source_asin":"B09215ZXY2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-695654","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09215ZXY2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09215ZXY2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
