window.products.push({"id":695667,"name":"Lavender Mist Set of 3 Kitchen Towels / Tea Towels / Bar Towels / Kitchen Cloths, 100% Absorbent Cotton, Size 19 3/4 inch x 27 1/2 inch (Birds)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HqvVKYOsL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"A must have in every kitchen – towels! Our bar towels for kitchenare not just your typical shabby kitchen cloths used for wiping, cleaning and drying basic kitchen wares. Stylish, rustic, classic and beautiful, our plenty handy towels collection offers everything you need to give your home kitchen a shabby chic, a rustic and uplifted feel. These kitchen hand towel are made from high quality cotton and are both decorative and functional. Hang or frame them as decorative pieces to give your kitchen a more homey and vibrant feel, or use them as how they are supposed to be used – cleaning of your household essentials and all your kitchen items. If you have seen pretty kitchen set ups on the internet, most especially in Instagram and Pinterest, your simple kitchen accessories for home will start your way to these Instagram and Pinterest worthy home / kitchens. The absorbent kitchen towels have vintage and classic designs that will make you not worry about just leaving them hanging or lying around your kitchen after each use. They are also designed to minimize lint and resist any shrinkage after machine washing and drying. This dish towel set are right up at par with Kitchen Aid, Decocar Cocina, Bee Brand Farmhouse Kitchen towels – they are as pretty but more affordable! Same quality, durability and appeal. These have so many possibilities! Use as cleaning dish towels or as decor! Get a small decorative ladder for your kitchen and hang your towels there! Use as coffee bar decor, bathroom hand towel holder, or hang it in your gallery wall. You can display it on your walls or hang a picture from it. So many great ideas. This is also a great gift idea for anybody on your list this Christmas! Surprise guests, family and friends with an eye catching towel which can serve as conversation piece.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HqvVKYOsL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lavender Mist","source_asin":"B08KVNG8YN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-695667","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KVNG8YN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KVNG8YN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
