window.products.push({"id":695677,"name":"[Upright Topiary Tree Storage Bag] - 5 Foot Christmas Tree Storage Bag for Foyer Style Artificial Trees up to 5 Feet Tall - Keep Your Fake Tree Standi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.23,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pfM8Y51XL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"You already know the importance of keeping your artificial topiary trees covered during the offseason to keep out moisture, dust, and bugs; However, finding a way to store decorative topiary trees isn’t easy. Most tree storage bags are designed for larger trees and don’t fit, but storing them in a duffel bag with several other decorations leads to your topiary tree being mangled and damaged. This Topiary Tree Storage Bag protects your topiary trees up to 60\" tall, and saves you the time of disassembling and undecorating while preparing for storage. Simply slide the bag over the top of the tree and pull it down to the bottom of the tree. Pull the drawstring to close the opening of the bag around the base of the tree. The durable, wipe-clean polyester fabric will prevent layers of dust from building up on the branches and decorations. Reinforced long handles on the side ensure safe and easy transportation of the trees. Make storing and protecting your topiary trees and Christmas trees quick and simple with this tree storage bag.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pfM8Y51XL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Santa's Bags","source_asin":"B07VN8TGGZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-695677","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VN8TGGZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VN8TGGZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":695678,"name":"SMARTAKE 200 Pcs White Parchment Paper Baking Sheets Round, 9 Inches Non-Stick Precut Baking Parchment, Perfect for Baking Grilling Air Fryer Steaming","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QbdKrrwML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"White color. Make your baking experience more enjoyable Pre-cut parchment paper no longer curls up and reduces the work of measuring and cutting the paper, non-stick coating makes your baking bread or cake or anything else attractive looking. Features: Convenient: Pre-cut parchment lays flat on the sheet, making it quicker and easier to get started with your baking. Sheets won't curl and fit perfectly on most baking sheets Non-Toxic and Unbleached: Baker's Signature Parchment Sheets are eco-friendly and unbleached. Made from 100% natural wood pulp with an addition of silicone coating. NON-STICK - Pastels won't stick to parchment paper, no additional oil, grease or sprays required.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QbdKrrwML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SMARTAKE","source_asin":"B087RQBYCV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-695678","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087RQBYCV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087RQBYCV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":695679,"name":"Magenta and Coral Floral by Silvia Vassileva, 22x32-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":68.26,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FtlfOAGTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a stylized pattern of pink and orange flowers on a tan and grey background.Silvia Vassileva pursued her love of art at the Academy of fine art in Bulgaria, where she earned both her bachelor's and master's degrees. She spent six years painting and exhibiting her work in Japan before moving to the U.S. Silvia describes her style as very free and bold. She makes her paintings come alive by using contrast and unusual color palettes. Silvia's home studio, which she designed herself, is bright, contemporary and minimalist.Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FtlfOAGTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B071X9P4T3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-695679","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071X9P4T3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071X9P4T3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
