window.products.push({"id":695745,"name":"Valentines Day Decor 2pcs Valentine Gnomes Plush Valentines Day Decoration Valentines Home Table Decor Scandinavian Tomte Elf Gnomes Ornaments Sweet V","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Aeq7R0f9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💕Valentines Day Decor -- In folklore, the gnome brings good luck to families and is regarded as good luck. Add holiday charm to your Valentine's Day home decorations with these adorable Swedish tomtes. It is perfect to decorate your tiered tray, desk, table, sofa, bookcase, shelf, or a special place in your home. 💕Handcrafted & Premium Material Valentines Day Decoration -- Our Valentine Gnome Couple is made of soft felt, cotton fabric, wooden nose, fiber white beard, and tall hat for posing. The girl one has braids instead of beards. The heavier bottom allowed him to stand alone. Gnomes are handcrafted, so different two will have some differences in size and weight. 💕Eye-Catching Design Valentines Day Gifts-- We really put many joys into the valentines gnomes with the unique designs. The cute heart sign and Cupid's Arrow hold in the gnome's arms, and the beard is white and has comfortable touch. These red grey gnomes definitely will be the attractive design and will the hit of your valentines party decorations. 💕Valentines Day Gifts For Him/Her -- Do you need a unique Valentine's gift? Your lover will be so surprised with these cute gnomes. It makes a great gift and can be displayed anywhere in the home or office. Every time your lover sees them, they will remember the sweet memories and smile with a raised mouth. 💕Perfect Size Valentines Day Gifts -- On the romantic Valentines day, the Valentines gnomes are the perfect decorations for your home with the perfect size design, they are about 13.4\" tall and 4.7 \" wide, you can put it on your fireplace, mantle, table, window, shelf, and it will stand out from your home decor.These gnomes will be a wonderful decorations of the Valentine's day space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Aeq7R0f9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Teeker","source_asin":"B09MZ6JGQB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-695745","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MZ6JGQB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MZ6JGQB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
