window.products.push({"id":695900,"name":"Fur Coat Garment Bags for Travel & Hanging Clothes (Grey) - Suit Covers Garment Bag for Men & Women Dress Bag - Closet Storage Suit Bag, Dress Bags, C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hlf8vkyUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A high quality garment bag is important for protecting expensive clothes like furs, suits, dresses, and coats. We pride ourselves on our Made in the USA cotton garment bags that are naturally breathable and rip resistant to protect your garments wherever they may be, whether hanging in the back of your closet or while you travel. Enjoy our options of sleek black bags or traditional grey with your choice of black, houndstooth or purple trim.BENEFITS & FEATURESCreated Especially for Fur CoatsMade in the USALonger 45” and 60” OptionsBreathable FabricHeavy Duty and DurableSmooth Glide ZipperLightweight DesignDifferent Color Options for Easier OrganizationFits Men’s Suits and Women’s DressesGreat for Travel4” Reinforced GussetBETTER PROTECTIONPremium fabric garment bags offer superior protection compared to poly fabrics and non woven fabrics. Our cotton blend fabric is naturally breathable, which makes it perfect for storage in all seasons and climates. It can help prevent dampness build up or stale air that can cause odors. Keep your important pieces fresh, clean and ready to wear even after months or years of storage.4 INCH GUSSETBeware of garment bags without a gusset design. Those bags taper at the edges to squeeze and compress your clothing. This can lead to permanent wrinkles and pleats, particularly in delicate fabric pieces like dresses or furs. The 4 inch gusset on our bags is wide enough to store a couple of men’s suits without compressing or bunching.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hlf8vkyUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TUVAINC","source_asin":"B0C7FFRVHS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-695900","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7FFRVHS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7FFRVHS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
