window.products.push({"id":695960,"name":"UniqXmas Personalized Twins Christmas Ornament 2023 – Free Customization | Custom Twin Brothers Baby Boys Blue Xmas Tree Decoration – New Babies' Firs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OTgA7WW0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Design your winter wonderland inside by hanging personalized relic décor customized with year, message and first name or last name labels. Upgraded with matching ribbon loop, our ornament is easy to hang on branches of Christmas trees or indoor holiday wreaths. Turn decorating the tree into a family activity to make Merry Christmas memories! Modern, elegant and totally cool, our ornaments are to be treasured & handed down as personal heirlooms. Our designer supplies fresh designs inspired by life's most meaningful moments you don't ever want to escape the memory. Hang the hand-painted accessories on your tree Christmas Eve and leave them up until New Year to welcome new beginnings surrounded by love. FREE CUSTOMIZATION Our highly specialized calligraphy artist customizes your ornament for free. CUSTOMIZED TO YOUR LIKING We believe ornaments and Christmas trees should be personal. That’s why you can customize this ornament to your liking. Here’s how: Click the “Customize Now” button above/to the right; Click the “Customize Now” button above/to the right; Enter in your personalized information; Enter in your personalized information; Please use only Latin characters; Please use only Latin characters; Please review the text and ensure there are no spelling errors; Please review the text and ensure there are no spelling errors; Place your order; Place your order; This works for all of our customized ornament products! It will take just a few minutes. COMPLIMENTARY RIBBON LOOP Our ornament comes with a complimentary ribbon loop matching your ornament for easy hanging and display. Now you don’t have to run to the store to go buy a ribbon at the last second. THE PERFECT GIFT If you want to surprise your family member, sister, mother, cousin, child, grandkid, friend, or coworker with a Christmas gift they won’t likely forget, consider our cute Twins Ornament today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OTgA7WW0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UniqXmas","source_asin":"B09H5217FL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-695960","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09H5217FL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09H5217FL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
