window.products.push({"id":695986,"name":"Navy Blue Balloon Arch Garland Kit-134pcs, 4 Size Navy Blue White Chrome Gold and Confetti Balloons for Graduation, Baby Shower, Birthday Party, Weddi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71B3Btp5DGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The party decoration supplies 62pcs navy blue balloons(5''-30pcs, 10''-30pcs,18''-2pcs), 27pcs white balloons(5''-15pcs, 10''-5pcs, 12''-5pcs, 18''-2pcs), 35pcs metallic chrome balloons(5''-25pcs, 10''-10pcs), 10pcs 12inch gold confetti balloons, 1pc 5 meters balloon chain, 1pc glue dots(100 dots), 2pcs hooks, 1pc 10 meters ribbon. The colours of the navy blue white gold balloon arch kit comes out absolutely beautiful. The bavy blue balloon garland arch kit is super easy to assemble and put together. Word of advice, inflate balloons before you need them to save yourself some time the event day. It is very joyful putting it together and the end results will be perfection for your party. The navy blue balloon garland kit is perfect for graduation,baby shower, birthday party, bridal shower, garden party, gender reveal party, wedding, family party, kid's party. This is the easiest decoration with the biggest \"wow\" factor at any party indoor or outdoor as a photo booth backdrop. All balloons are made by natural latex of high quality, safety, non-toxic and very durable.After blowing up the confetti balloons, please rub the balloons' surface by carpet or tower to get the static electricity. Then you shake the confetti balloons, and the pieces will be sticked on the sides.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71B3Btp5DGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YaterYing","source_asin":"B0C6NV51K4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-695986","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6NV51K4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6NV51K4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":695987,"name":"KitchenAid Silicone Slotted Turner, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uAguHvrHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product description Sliding under a delicate piece of fish or a crepe you need a spatula that has gently curved edges and a wide head, with just the right amount of bend vs. resistance. You also want a slotted spatula capable of effortlessly lifting weightier foods like a salmon steak. Thanks to its remarkable heat-resistance you can leave it resting against the skillet without melting it. Durable, good looking, and designed with both function and comfort in mind, this tool coordinates with your red KitchenAid appliances. Amazon.com This flexible spatula bends with your food, not against it, so you won't end up mangling the delicate omelet you're trying to flip. The 4-by-5-inch head has rounded corners and tapered edges to slide easily underneath the biggest pancake or the heaviest burger, and the slotted surface leaves cooking grease and sauce behind in the pan. Because it's constructed from highly heat-resistant silicone, this turner won't melt if you leave it propped up against a skillet, and it won't scratch or otherwise harm your beloved nonstick pans. The KitchenAid logo even doubles as a spatula rest, so you can place the turner up against the rim of a pan without it sliding in. With its cheery chrome accents and convenient hanging loop, this turner will brighten your kitchen even as it stays within arm's reach. --Mary Park","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uAguHvrHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KitchenAid","source_asin":"B00005KI6I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-695987","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005KI6I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005KI6I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
